ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605152323199368_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605152323199368_720.jpg"> </div><p>【U17男足进半决赛】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/match1982704date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进军四强！U17国足3-1逆转沙特 何思凡传射+一条龙万项赵松源破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260516/zhanbao_image_1982704_1778872032_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260516/zhanbao_image_1982704_1778872032_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260516/zhanbao_image_1982704_1778872032_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">17国足客场3-1逆转沙特晋级四强，半决赛将对阵越南U17与澳大利亚之间的胜者。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/6a0770d905184native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">复仇战预定？若U17男足闯过半决赛，可能决赛再战日本争冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160323244433.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160323244433_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160323244433_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">如果中国队成功晋级决赛，日本也顺利晋级，那么两队将在决赛会师，在本届赛事再度交手并争夺冠军。</span></p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/match1713740date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">3轮不胜！利物浦2-4维拉 索博2助+滑倒致丢球维拉锁定前五</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260516/zhanbao_image_1713740_1778878408_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260516/zhanbao_image_1713740_1778878408_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260516/zhanbao_image_1713740_1778878408_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">维拉在主场以4-2的比分战胜利物浦。维拉获得欧冠资格，利物浦则是连续3轮不胜，战绩2负1平，暂时排名英超第五。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/6a07891f3b771native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超积分榜：维拉锁定欧冠资格，利物浦掉第五、先赛领先樱桃4分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.36" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160520592306.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.36" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.36" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160520592306_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160520592306_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">利物浦掉至第五，先赛领先伯恩茅斯4分。维拉升至第四，锁定前五提前一轮获得欧冠资格。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/6a078a23c4c57native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安心备战欧联决赛！维拉提前获欧冠资格，还剩2场对弗赖堡、曼城</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.38" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260222/6999df1d7cf84.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.38" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.38" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260222/6999df1d7cf84.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260222/6999df1d7cf84.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">维拉62分排名第四，领先伯恩茅斯7分，提前确保联赛前五锁定欧冠资格。</span></p><p>【诺伊尔续约】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a0732f88b98bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传奇继续！官方：40岁诺伊尔与拜仁续约至2027年，据悉为降薪续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605152307596869.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605152307596869.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605152307596869.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">拜仁官方发布公告，球队与40岁诺伊尔、37岁乌尔赖希完成续约，新合同为期1年。</span></p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/6a074c5b7ad02native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">与巴西、摩洛哥同组！海地世界杯26人名单：狼队中场贝莱加德在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/6a06dd5737c0c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/6a06dd5737c0c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/6a06dd5737c0c.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">海地公布世界杯26人名单，狼队中场贝莱加德在列。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/6a075e57ead66native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">与荷兰、日本同组！突尼斯世界杯26人名单：汉尼拔在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/6a06e066828bf.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/6a06e066828bf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/6a06e066828bf.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">突尼斯公布世界杯26人名单，拉尼·赫迪拉在列，曼联旧将汉尼拔入选。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-16/6a07691e91788native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">告别红狼军团！官方：33岁沙拉维本赛季结束后离开罗马</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.66" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160243383363.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605160243383